  CellId, CellReadiness, CellReady, CellQuarantined, UnprovenFact, FactNotObserved, FactObservedFailing,
  SanitationFact, SanitationObservation, FactConfirmed, FactRefuted, FactUnobservable,
  SanitationFactAdmission, SanitationFactAdmitted, SanitationFactUnrecognized,
  sanitation_fact_label, admit_sanitation_fact,
}
